[{"code":"list_may_be_shared","severity":"error","span":{"file":"Main.beni","start":{"line":22,"col":14},"end":{"line":22,"col":43}},"title":"LIST MAY BE SHARED","message":"`List.push` changes `model.errors` in place, and the checker cannot show that\nnothing else still holds the list.\n\n21|    picture = viewErrors model.errors\n       ^^^^^^^ `picture⟨render⟩⋆` keeps the list here\n                 ^^^^^^^^^^ `picture⟨render⟩⋆` may hold the list through this call\n22|    errors = List.push model.errors \"more\"\n                ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ the list is changed in place here\n23|    { model | errors = errors, picture = Just picture }\n                                                 ^^^^^^^ and `picture⟨render⟩⋆` is read here, after the change\n\nTo be safe, change a copy:\n\n22|    errors = List.push (List.copy model.errors) \"more\"\n\nThis is a limit of the checker, not proof of sharing: picture⟨render⟩⋆ may hold\nit through the call at 21:15, and is read at 23:42."},{"code":"list_may_be_shared","severity":"error","span":{"file":"Main.beni","start":{"line":31,"col":8},"end":{"line":31,"col":19}},"title":"LIST MAY BE SHARED","message":"`update` changes `model.errors` in place, and the checker cannot show that\nnothing else still holds the list.\n\n31|main = Tea.sandbox { init = λ⊤ → { errors = [], picture = Nothing }, update = update, view = view }\n          ^^^^^^^^^^^ the runtime hands `update` the model here\n\nCopy the list with `List.copy` where the model gets it, so that nothing else\nholds the list `update` changes.\n\nThis is a limit of the checker, not proof of sharing: another path of the model\nmay hold it after some message: update's arms are joined, so the entry cannot\ntell them apart."}]
